    title: "藥品物流業者久裕遭駭客二度攻擊，復原系統資料疑似外洩，影響出貨時程",
    summary: "藥品流通與醫療物流業者久裕（4173）於8月10日發布資安重訊，指出公司遭遇駭客攻擊。隨後於11日發布第二則重訊，揭露攻擊目標已擴及其復原系統。經外部資安公司調查，初步判斷遭加密的資料可能發生外洩疑慮，且部分檔案出現無法解密的情況。雖然久裕強調核心系統及資料庫未受影響，初步評估對公司營運無重大影響，但由於前次事故的復原作業將會延長，預計會導致部分客戶的出貨時程受到影響。本次事件屬於典型的資安事件後續追蹤與影響評估，顯示企業在遭受攻擊後，其備援與復原系統也可能成為駭客的攻擊目標。",
    tags: ["久裕", "資安事件", "復原系統", "資料外洩", "醫療物流"],
    title_en: "Pharmaceutical Logistics Company Chiu Yu Suffers Second Hacker Attack; System Data Recovery Suspected of Leakage, Affecting Shipment Schedules",
    summary_en: "Pharmaceutical distribution and medical logistics company Chiu Yu (4173) issued a security alert on August 10, indicating that the company had been targeted by a hacker attack. A second alert was issued on the 11th, revealing that the attack target had expanded to include its recovery systems. According to an investigation by an external cybersecurity firm, preliminary assessments suggest that encrypted data may have leaked, and some files were found to be irrecoverable. Although Chiu Yu emphasized that its core systems and databases were unaffected, and preliminary assessments indicated no major impact on company operations, the extended recovery process from the previous incident is expected to affect the shipment schedules of some clients. This incident represents a typical follow-up investigation and impact assessment following a cybersecurity event, demonstrating that a company's backup and recovery systems can also become targets for hackers after an attack.",
