    title: "Manjaro Linux 26.1 發布：搭載 GNOME 50 與 KDE Plasma 6.7 桌面環境",
    summary: "Manjaro Linux 26.1 已作為最新的功能性發行版發布，這是一個建立在 Arch Linux 基礎上的桌面 Linux 發行版。本次更新自 Manjaro 26.0（於一月發布）以來，帶來了多個新套件。Manjaro 26.1 的主要亮點是提供了 GNOME 50 和 KDE Plasma 6.7 這兩個最新的桌面環境。此外，對於偏好輕量級桌面的用戶，也提供了 Xfce 4.20 版本。在核心系統方面，Manjaro Linux 26.1 採用 Linux 7.1 穩定核心，同時也為用戶提供了 Linux 6.18 LTS 和 Linux 6.12 LTS 等長期支援核心選項。這是一個面向用戶介面和核心元件的重大更新，建議用戶關注 Manjaro.org 論壇以獲取更多詳細資訊。",
    tags: ["Manjaro Linux", "Arch Linux", "GNOME 50", "KDE Plasma 6.7", "Linux 7.1", "Linux 發行版"],
    title_en: "Manjaro Linux 26.1 Released: Featuring GNOME 50 and KDE Plasma 6.7 Desktop Environments",
    summary_en: "Manjaro Linux 26.1 has been released as the latest feature release, a desktop Linux distribution built on Arch Linux. Since the Manjaro 26.0 release (published in January), this update brings several new packages. The main highlights of Manjaro 26.1 are the inclusion of the latest desktop environments, GNOME 50 and KDE Plasma 6.7. Additionally, Xfce 4.20 is provided for users who prefer a lightweight desktop. On the core system front, Manjaro Linux 26.1 utilizes the Linux 7.1 stable kernel, while also offering long-term support kernel options such as Linux 6.18 LTS and Linux 6.12 LTS. This represents a major update for both the user interface and core components, and users are advised to monitor the Manjaro.org forum for more detailed information.",
