    category: "Linux",
    title: "Linux 核心漏洞：8250_mid 驅動程式在 DNV/ICX-D/SNR 平台存在 NULL 指標解引用風險",
    summary: "本漏洞影響 Linux 核心的 `8250_mid` 驅動程式，專門針對 DNV (Denverton)、ICX-D/CDF (Ice Lake Xeon D) 或 SNR (Snowridge) 等平台。問題出在 `mid8250_probe()` 和 `mid8250_remove()` 函式中，雖然透過 Commit b1b4efea05a5 替換了 `dnv_board` 的 setup 和 exit 回呼，但後續的程式碼仍會無條件解引用這些函式指標，而未進行 NULL 值檢查。若這些指標為 NULL，將導致 NULL 指標解引用，進而造成核心崩潰（kernel oops）。修補建議是必須在呼叫 setup 和 exit 回呼之前，加入必要的 NULL 值檢查機制，以確保系統穩定性。受影響版本範圍廣泛，建議系統管理員應立即更新到修補後的 Linux 核心版本。",
    tags: ["Linux 核心", "8250_mid", "NULL 指標解引用", "DNV", "ICX-D", "内核漏洞"],
    title_en: "Linux Kernel Vulnerability: NULL Pointer Dereference Risk in 8250_mid Driver on DNV/ICX-D/SNR Platforms",
    summary_en: "This vulnerability affects the `8250_mid` driver in the Linux kernel, specifically targeting platforms such as DNV (Denverton), ICX-D/CDF (Ice Lake Xeon D), or SNR (Snowridge). The issue resides in the `mid8250_probe()` and `mid8250_remove()` functions. Although Commit b1b4efea05a5 replaced the `dnv_board` setup and exit callbacks, subsequent code still unconditionally dereferences these function pointers without performing a NULL check. If these pointers are NULL, it will cause a NULL pointer dereference, leading to a kernel crash (kernel oops). The suggested fix is to implement necessary NULL value checks before calling the setup and exit callbacks to ensure system stability. Since the affected version range is wide, system administrators are advised to immediately update to the patched Linux kernel version.",
    tags_en: ["Linux Kernel", "8250_mid", "NULL Pointer Dereference", "DNV", "ICX-D", "Kernel Vulnerability"],
    sources: [
      { name: "NVD CVE API", url: "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-68434", lang: "EN" }
    ]
