    id: "20260812-059",
    trackers: ["security"],
    category: "漏洞與威脅情報",
    title: "Cisco ASA/FTD 設備遭利用新漏洞：遠端存取服務可觸發服務拒絕攻擊",
    summary: "資安廠商 Cisco 發出警告，指出一款影響 Secure Firewall Adaptive Security Appliance (ASA) Software 和 Secure Firewall Threat Defense (FTD) Software 的高嚴重性漏洞 (CVE-2026-20349, CVSS 8.6) 已在野外被利用。此漏洞源於處理 HTTP 請求時的錯誤檢查不足，允許未經身份驗證的遠端攻擊者透過發送惡意編造的 HTTP 請求，攻擊受影響設備的 Remote Access SSL VPN 服務，從而觸發服務拒絕 (DoS) 狀態，導致設備重載。受影響的設備版本包含多個 ASA 和 FTD 的舊版配置。Cisco 建議用戶應立即升級至修復版本，例如 ASA 9.161 應升級至 89.16.4.50，FTD 7.0 應升級至 Cisco_FTD_Hotfix_GC-7.0.9.1-1.sh.REL.tar 等。由於此漏洞已被證實正在被利用，美國 CISA 已將其納入 Known Exploited Vulnerabilities (KEV) 目錄，要求聯邦民事行政部門在 2026 年 8 月 14 日前修補。",
    tags: ["Cisco", "CVE-2026-20349", "ASA", "FTD", "SSL-VPN", "DoS"],
    title_en: "Cisco ASA/FTD Devices Exploited via New Vulnerability: Remote Access Service Can Trigger Denial of Service Attack",
    summary_en: "Cybersecurity vendor Cisco has issued a warning regarding a high-severity vulnerability (CVE-2026-20349, CVSS 8.6) affecting Secure Firewall Adaptive Security Appliance (ASA) Software and Secure Firewall Threat Defense (FTD) Software, which has been exploited in the wild. The vulnerability stems from insufficient error checking when processing HTTP requests, allowing unauthenticated remote attackers to target the affected device's Remote Access SSL VPN service by sending malicious, crafted HTTP requests. This action can trigger a Denial of Service (DoS) state, causing the device to reload. Affected device versions include multiple older configurations of ASA and FTD. Cisco recommends that users immediately upgrade to a patched version, such as upgrading ASA 9.161 to 89.16.4.50, or FTD 7.0 to Cisco_FTD_Hotfix_GC-7.0.9.1-1.sh.REL.tar. Because this vulnerability has been confirmed to be exploited, the U.S. CISA has included it in the Known Exploited Vulnerabilities (KEV) catalog, requiring federal civilian agencies to patch by August 14, 2026.",
    tags_en: ["Cisco", "CVE-2026-20349", "ASA", "FTD", "SSL-VPN", "DoS"],
    sources: [
      { name: "The Hacker News", url: "https://thehackernews.com/2026/08/cisco-asa-and-ftd-flaw-exploited-in.html", lang: "EN" }
    ]
