    title: "Apple Wallet 即將升級：新增管理折抵交易（Trade-in）功能，延長優惠有效期至 90 天",
    summary: "根據 MacRumors 發現的程式碼分析，Apple Wallet 應用程式預計將迎來重大功能升級，核心圍繞在折抵交易（trade-in）的管理。目前 Apple 的折抵報價有效期為 14 天，但新的程式碼字串顯示，該功能可能將有效期延長至 90 天。此功能透過 Apple 的 Guide 應用程式（主要供 Apple 員工和授權經銷商使用）觸發，用戶只需掃描 QR Code 即可將折抵優惠儲存至 Apple Wallet。此外，程式碼中還提到了名為 \"TradeInKit\" 的框架。報導指出，這些新功能目前由伺服器端控制，尚未正式啟用。此升級預計能大幅改善 Apple 購物體驗，特別是在當前物價上漲的背景下，讓用戶能更方便地管理和利用其舊設備的折抵價值。",
    tags: ["Apple Wallet", "Apple Guide", "Trade-in", "Apple Watch", "iPhone", "macOS"],
    title_en: "Apple Wallet set for upgrade: New Trade-in management feature extends offer validity to 90 days",
    summary_en: "Code analysis reported by MacRumors suggests that the Apple Wallet application is slated for a major feature upgrade, focusing on trade-in management. Currently, Apple's trade-in quote validity is 14 days, but new code strings indicate that this feature may extend the validity period to 90 days. This functionality is triggered via the Apple Guide application (primarily used by Apple employees and authorized resellers), allowing users to save a trade-in offer to Apple Wallet simply by scanning a QR Code. Furthermore, the code mentions a framework named \"TradeInKit.\" The report notes that these new features are currently server-side controlled and not yet officially enabled. This upgrade is expected to significantly improve the Apple shopping experience, especially amid current inflationary pressures, allowing users to more easily manage and utilize the trade-in value of their old devices.",
