    title: "Apple Watch watchOS 26 提升睡眠追蹤功能：自訂通知範圍優化用戶體驗",
    summary: "Apple Watch 內建的睡眠追蹤功能，在 watchOS 26 中透過「睡眠分數」（Sleep Score）功能進一步優化，讓用戶能更精準地掌握夜間睡眠品質。睡眠分數透過計算睡眠時長、就寢時間一致性及夜間中斷等指標，提供一個可視覺化的分數。用戶可以透過 iPhone 或 Apple Watch 的設定，自訂接收睡眠分數通知的特定範圍。例如，用戶可以選擇僅在分數為「OK」、「Low」或「Very Low」時收到警報，避免過度關注高分（High/Very High）而產生焦慮。這項功能對於幫助用戶反思低分背後的原因，進行改善非常有幫助。若要使用此功能，需搭配 watchOS 26，適用於 Apple Watch Series 6 及更新機型、Apple Watch Ultra 及更新機型，以及 Apple Watch SE 2 及更新機型。",
    tags: ["Apple Watch", "watchOS 26", "睡眠追蹤", "Sleep Score", "Apple Health"],
    title_en: "Apple Watch watchOS 26 Enhances Sleep Tracking with Customizable Notification Ranges for Improved User Experience",
    summary_en: "The built-in sleep tracking feature on the Apple Watch is further optimized in watchOS 26 through the 'Sleep Score' function, allowing users to gain more precise insights into their nighttime sleep quality. The Sleep Score provides a visual score calculated based on metrics such as sleep duration, consistency of bedtime, and nighttime interruptions. Users can customize the specific ranges for receiving Sleep Score notifications via the iPhone or Apple Watch settings. For instance, users can choose to receive alerts only when the score is 'OK,' 'Low,' or 'Very Low,' thereby preventing anxiety from over-focusing on high scores (High/Very High). This feature is highly beneficial for helping users reflect on the causes behind low scores and take corrective action. To use this feature, users must have watchOS 26, and it is compatible with Apple Watch Series 6 and later, Apple Watch Ultra and later, and Apple Watch SE 2 and later.",
    tags_en: ["Apple Watch", "watchOS 26", "Sleep Tracking", "Sleep Score", "Apple Health"],
