    id: "20260812-088",
    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "Android",
    title: "Google Pixel Watch 5 推出史蒂芬·柯瑞限定版，強調運動功能與獨家設計",
    summary: "Google 最新發布 Pixel Watch 5，除了標準型號外，還推出了「Stephen Curry Special Edition」限定版。此版本與 NBA 球星 Stephen Curry 合作，專為運動愛好者設計。限定版配備的錶帶採用再生聚酯纖維和 HNBR，並具備防水塗層，強調透氣性和耐汗性。相較於 Fitbit Air 的類似款，Pixel Watch 5 的限定版透過不鏽鋼錶耳連接，更顯堅固。由於 Pixel Watch 5 具備顯示螢幕，此限定版還包含一個獨家錶面，這是其他 Google 穿戴裝置無法獲得的。該限定版為單一組合包販售，適用手腕尺寸介於 165 至 215mm，且僅限於較大且價格更高的 45mm 尺寸。預購價格為 $579，預計於 9 月 3 日上市。",
    tags: ["Google", "Pixel Watch 5", "Stephen Curry", "Wearables", "Android", "Smartwatch"],
    title_en: "Google Pixel Watch 5 Launches Stephen Curry Special Edition, Highlighting Fitness Features and Exclusive Design",
    summary_en: "Google has recently released the Pixel Watch 5, which includes a 'Stephen Curry Special Edition' limited model alongside the standard version. This limited edition collaborates with NBA star Stephen Curry and is designed specifically for fitness enthusiasts. The strap on the limited edition uses recycled polyester and HNBR, and features a waterproof coating, emphasizing breathability and sweat resistance. Compared to similar models like the Fitbit Air, the Pixel Watch 5's limited edition boasts a more robust design through its stainless steel lugs. Furthermore, because the Pixel Watch 5 features a display screen, this limited edition includes an exclusive watch face unavailable on other Google wearable devices. The limited edition is sold as a single bundle, suitable for wrist sizes between 165 and 215mm, and is exclusively available in the larger and more expensive 45mm size. The pre-order price is $579, with an expected launch date of September 3rd.",
    tags_en: ["Google", "Pixel Watch 5", "Stephen Curry", "Wearables", "Android", "Smartwatch"],
