    category: "Android",
    title: "Google發表Pixel Tag：第一方Find Hub追蹤器，具備超寬頻定位與IP67防水防塵",
    summary: "Google在Made by Google 2026活動上，發表了Pixel Tag，這是一款第一方Find Hub追蹤器。該設備採用膠囊形設計，具備加速度計、揚聲器、藍牙和超寬頻（Ultra Wideband）技術，能夠提供精準定位，並透過「視覺距離和方向提示」引導用戶，定位範圍可達50公尺。Pixel Tag支援Android 9及更高版本，用戶只需移除電池蓋即可快速配對。它由聚碳酸酯和金屬材質製成，並具備IP67等級的防水防塵能力（在1公尺深度下可承受30分鐘）。Pixel Tag的價格為29美元，四件組合包為99美元，預計於11月11日上市。",
    tags: ["Google", "Pixel Tag", "Find Hub", "Ultra Wideband", "Android", "IP67"],
    title_en: "Google Unveils Pixel Tag: First-Party Find Hub Tracker with Ultra Wideband Positioning and IP67 Waterproofing",
    summary_en: "At the Made by Google 2026 event, Google unveiled the Pixel Tag, a first-party Find Hub tracker. The device features a capsule design and incorporates an accelerometer, speaker, Bluetooth, and Ultra Wideband technology, enabling precise location tracking and guiding users through 'visual distance and direction prompts.' It has a detection range of up to 50 meters. Pixel Tag supports Android 9 and higher, and users can quickly pair it by simply removing the battery cover. Constructed from polycarbonate and metal, the device boasts IP67 waterproof and dustproof ratings (withstanding 30 minutes at a depth of 1 meter). The Pixel Tag is priced at $29, with a four-pack bundle available for $99, and is scheduled to launch on November 11th.",
