    title: "中國阻止 Meta 收購 Manus AI，該公司宣布恢復獨立營運",
    summary: "Manus AI 曾於 2025 年 3 月推出「通用代理」（general agent）技術，能夠讓使用者指派任務給 AI，例如透過讀取和評估 ZIP 檔案中的工作申請，並根據使用者定義的標準撰寫排名文件。該服務曾吸引大量用戶，並聲稱達到 1 億美元的營運速率。原本 Meta 創辦人 Mark Zuckerberg 於 2025 年 12 月宣布收購 Manus，計劃將其技術整合到 The Social Network 的 AI 產品線，包括 Meta AI。然而，由於中國政府在 2026 年初對此次收購展開調查，並至 4 月決定禁止外國對 Manus 的投資，Meta 最終決定放棄收購。目前，Manus 已發布公告，宣布將恢復獨立營運。但由於法律要求，Manus 必須刪除自 2025 年 12 月 29 日以來生成的部分用戶數據，並計劃於 8 月 24 日執行此刪除。用戶需在該日期前下載數據，才能在 8 月 25 日恢復使用。",
    tags: ["Meta", "Manus AI", "通用代理", "AI 產業", "中國市場", "數據隱私"],
    title_en: "China Blocks Meta's Acquisition of Manus AI; Company Announces Return to Independent Operations",
    summary_en: "Manus AI launched its 'general agent' technology in March 2025, enabling users to assign tasks to AI, such as reading and evaluating job applications within ZIP files and generating ranking documents based on user-defined criteria. The service attracted a large user base and claimed an operational rate of $100 million. Originally, Meta co-founder Mark Zuckerberg announced the acquisition of Manus in December 2025, planning to integrate its technology into The Social Network's AI product line, including Meta AI. However, due to an investigation by the Chinese government into the acquisition in early 2026, and a subsequent decision in April to prohibit foreign investment in Manus, Meta ultimately abandoned the acquisition. Manus has since issued a public announcement declaring its return to independent operations. However, due to legal requirements, Manus must delete some user data generated since December 29, 2025, and plans to execute this deletion on August 24. Users must download their data before this date to resume service on August 25.",
    tags_en: ["Meta", "Manus AI", "General Agent", "AI Industry", "Chinese Market", "Data Privacy"],
