    title_en: "Lenovo IdeaPad Vibe Challenges MacBook Neo with Seven Color Options, Featuring Snapdragon and AMD Processors",
    summary_en: "This article reports on the upcoming Lenovo IdeaPad Vibe laptop, which is positioned as a strong competitor to the Apple MacBook Neo. The IdeaPad Vibe offers seven color choices (including blush pink, bright yellow, terracotta orange, sage green, navy blue, silver, and mint green), more than the four colors offered by the MacBook Neo, aiming to attract the casual market segment that values design and color. In terms of design, it features a minimalist aesthetic, a thin-bezel screen, and a visible privacy camera shutter. Compared to the MacBook Neo, the IdeaPad Vibe boasts a more comprehensive port configuration: the left side includes HDMI, two USB-C ports, a headphone jack, and a microSD card slot, while the right side features two USB-A ports and a power button. Regarding the processor, the IdeaPad Vibe will offer at least two configurations: Qualcomm Snapdragon (ARM architecture) and AMD chips (x86 architecture), achieving cross-architecture color coverage. The launch of this laptop demonstrates the PC industry's proactive response to market demand for color and design.",
